	(text "Millstone-Differential Bridge -- A Balanced Bridge Dimensionless Signal Detector (BBDSD). \nRT1 (moonlit) / RT2 (shaded) are ~12in off-board flying leads via J1. \nRf_A/Rf_B are 0.01% 5ppm precision resistors. \nVEXC is the shared 2.048V bridge excitation from the parent sheet; mid_A/mid_B are the two bridge output \nlegs read differentially and single-ended by the ADC on the parent sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
